 "remarks": "Live a life of convenience to downtown Stamford and easy access to train/highways in this condo located across from Mill River Park, which offers entertainment and other activities (concerts, movies, yoga, ice skating rink, nature and river views). 2 bedrooms, 2 baths, 2 large walk-in closets, washer & dryer, 9' ceilings and tall windows, open living/dining concept with terrace/balcony access and a master bedroom slider to the oversized terrace/balcony with private exterior staircase that provides for easy pet access to the street (up to 2 pets allowed/restrictions apply). NEW IN 2026: Freshly painted, wall/wall carpeting, gas range, microwave, dishwasher, kitchen faucet & garbage disposal, and master bath vanity & faucet. Enjoy the community courtyard patio with grills, exercise gym room and club room. Weekday doorman/concierge. There are 2 parking spaces with this unit, one assigned and one floating.",
